One-line meaning

Artifact Registry = Google's secure storage for Docker images and other build artifacts.

So remember:

GitHub = Code storage
Cloud Build = Builds the Docker image
Artifact Registry = Stores the Docker image
Cloud Run = Runs the Docker image 🚀

Artifact Registry stores the image that Cloud Run deploys, so 
the image naming and deployment commands that connect Artifact Registry to Cloud Run determine which version of your FastAPI app goes live.

